# Sales Performance 2024 Dashboard

# Project Overview
This Power BI dashboard provides an overview of sales performance for the year 2024.

The dashboard helps analyze sales trends, revenue, profit, and overall business performance.

# Tools Used
- Power BI
- Excel

# Dashboard Analysis
The dashboard includes:
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Sales Performance
- Monthly Sales Trends
- Product/Category Performance
- Regional Performance
- Sales Comparison

